---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/global/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/global/Footer.astro';
import Container from '../../components/global/Container.astro';
import Section from '../../components/global/Section.astro';
import TechnicalLabel from '../../components/global/TechnicalLabel.astro';
import Button from '../../components/global/Button.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Silicon X × AionSi | FPGA Engineering Capacity" description="AionSi engineering alignment for Silicon X across RTL, FPGA, Design Verification, DFT, physical implementation, validation and engineering automation.">
  <Header />
  <main>
    <Section class="bg-[var(--aionsi-surface-alt)] py-14 md:py-20 lg:py-24">
      <Container>
        <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.08fr_.72fr] lg:items-center">
          <div>
            <TechnicalLabel>SILICON X × AIONSI · ENGINEERING CAPACITY ALIGNMENT</TechnicalLabel>
            <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-5xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] tracking-tight text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] md:text-7xl">Engineering capacity for the next generation of FPGA products.</h1>
            <p class="mt-7 max-w-3xl text-xl leading-9 text-slate-600 md:text-2xl">Complement Silicon X engineering execution with focused AionSi teams aligned to defined FPGA, RTL, verification, implementation and validation work packages.</p>
            <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
              <Button href="/contact">Discuss an Engineering Requirement</Button>
              <a href="/capabilities" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-slate-300 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] transition hover:border-[var(--aionsi-blue)]">Explore Capabilities</a>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-slate-500">AionSi management team in Malaysia · 20 September–5 October 2026</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm">
            <TechnicalLabel>PARTNERSHIP MODEL</TechnicalLabel>
            <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Add execution capacity while Silicon X retains product ownership.</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">Start with a defined engineering requirement, prove delivery on a focused work package and scale only when the model is validated.</p>
            <div class="mt-7 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">
              <div class="border border-slate-200 p-4">Defined scope</div>
              <div class="border border-slate-200 p-4">Technical ownership</div>
              <div class="border border-slate-200 p-4">Milestone driven</div>
              <div class="border border-slate-200 p-4">Scalable capacity</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </Section>

    <Section class="py-12 md:py-18">
      <Container>
        <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.78fr_1.22fr] lg:items-start">
          <div>
            <TechnicalLabel>WHY THIS CONVERSATION</TechnicalLabel>
            <h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] md:text-5xl">Build another execution lane around a growing FPGA roadmap.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-8 text-slate-600">
            <p>Silicon X describes itself as a homegrown FPGA product company focused on low-latency, low-power and cost-effective programmable logic. Public information shows its proprietary FPGA has powered on and the company has been moving toward testing and commercialization.</p>
            <p>AionSi can potentially complement that product journey with focused semiconductor engineering capacity across RTL, verification, physical implementation, DFT, FPGA prototyping and validation.</p>
            <p class="font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">The first discussion should identify one concrete engineering work package where additional execution capacity can be evaluated against technical milestones.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </Section>

    <Section class="bg-white py-12 md:py-18">
      <Container>
        <TechnicalLabel>POTENTIAL ENGINEERING WORK PACKAGES</TechnicalLabel>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">Potential areas for a focused AionSi engineering team to operate alongside the Silicon X organization.</p>
        <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-7"><div class="text-xs tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">01 · FRONT END</div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">RTL & FPGA Design</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">RTL development, IP integration and subsystem execution for defined FPGA product requirements and interfaces.</p></div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-7"><div class="text-xs tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">02 · VERIFICATION</div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Design Verification</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">SystemVerilog/UVM verification, regressions, debug, coverage closure and reusable verification infrastructure.</p></div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-7"><div class="text-xs tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">03 · IMPLEMENTATION</div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Physical Design</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Synthesis, implementation, timing analysis, closure and signoff-oriented execution for defined blocks or milestones.</p></div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-7"><div class="text-xs tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">04 · TEST</div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">DFT & Validation</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">DFT, test strategy, pre-silicon validation and post-silicon engineering support around agreed technical scope.</p></div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-7"><div class="text-xs tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">05 · PROTOTYPE</div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">FPGA Prototyping</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Prototype bring-up, emulation, firmware interfaces, debug and system-level validation for faster engineering feedback.</p></div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-7"><div class="text-xs tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">06 · PRODUCTIVITY</div><h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Engineering Automation</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Regression, flow automation and AI-assisted engineering productivity aligned with existing development methodology.</p></div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </Section>

    <Section class="bg-[var(--aionsi-surface-alt)] py-12 md:py-18">
      <Container>
        <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr] lg:items-start">
          <div><TechnicalLabel>ENGINEERING LEVERAGE</TechnicalLabel><h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] md:text-5xl">Start with one work package. Scale after delivery is proven.</h2></div>
          <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Parallel execution</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Create an additional engineering lane without changing core product ownership.</p></div>
            <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Specialist capacity</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Add focused semiconductor expertise around a specific technical bottleneck or milestone.</p></div>
            <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Milestone support</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Structure delivery around verification closure, implementation targets, validation or product milestones.</p></div>
            <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Scale after validation</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Expand from a focused team to dedicated engineering capacity when collaboration and delivery are proven.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </Section>

    <Section class="py-12 md:py-18">
      <Container>
        <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.75fr_1.25fr]">
          <div><TechnicalLabel>DELIVERY MODEL</TechnicalLabel><h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] md:text-5xl">From engineering requirement to delivered work package.</h2></div>
          <div class="grid gap-3">
            <div class="border-b border-slate-200 py-5"><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">01 · UNDERSTAND</div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Clarify product stage, architecture, block or subsystem, tools, interfaces and milestone.</p></div>
            <div class="border-b border-slate-200 py-5"><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">02 · DEFINE</div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Agree scope, skills, tools, deliverables, ownership boundaries and acceptance criteria.</p></div>
            <div class="border-b border-slate-200 py-5"><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">03 · BUILD</div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Assign engineers with the required semiconductor and verification/implementation experience.</p></div>
            <div class="border-b border-slate-200 py-5"><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">04 · EXECUTE</div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Deliver against agreed technical milestones, quality gates and engineering KPIs.</p></div>
            <div class="py-5"><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">05 · VALIDATE & HANDOFF</div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Review outputs, close open items and complete documentation and knowledge transfer.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </Section>

    <Section class="bg-[var(--aionsi-navy)] py-14 md:py-20">
      <Container>
        <div class="max-w-4xl">
          <TechnicalLabel>FOR SILICON X ENGINEERING LEADERS</TechnicalLabel>
          <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white md:text-6xl">Have an engineering work package that needs additional execution capacity?</h2>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">Let’s discuss the requirement, technical ownership model and milestone where an AionSi team could complement the existing organization.</p>
          <div class="mt-8"><Button href="/contact">Discuss the Requirement</Button></div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </Section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
